      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "30",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izu dakufuma kudi Yehova denjili kudi Yeremiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Yehova Nzambi yaIsarela nahoshi nindi, Sonekaku mumukanda mazu ejima inahoshi naneyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Yehova nahoshi nindi, Tiyaku, kwamba kenza mafuku inakabalumuna wukoli wawantu ami aIsarela nawaYuda. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova. Nakayi funtisha cheŋi kwituŋa dinenkeli ankakulula jawu, kulonda akadiheti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu mazu ahosheliyi Yehova akutcna aIsarela nawaYuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Yehova nahoshi nindi, Tunatiyi izu dakuzaala, dawoma, hidakumwenaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ihujolenu dinu mutali neyi iyala wafunyishaŋa nyisoŋu yakuvwala. Indi ami namoni ŋahi amayala ejima anakwati makasawu hankuma, neyi mumbandawudinakufunyisha, nimesu awu ejima anatookoloki dehito-o? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayo! Ifuku odu deneni, hikudi dakweseka naduku. Diyi mpinji yayihuŋu yaYakoba. Hela chochu, akamwamwinamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamazaza nindi, Ifuku odu nakakotola mpanda yindi yidi munshiŋu yeyi, nakaketola nyonji yeyi. Antu akwacheŋi hiya kamu balumuna nawa cheŋi kwikala nduŋu yawuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akakalakela Nzambi yawu Yehova, nimwanta wawu Davidi inakayinyamwina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Dichi eyi kambuŋami Yakoba bayi wutiya womaku; eyi Isarela, bayi wakamaku. Muloŋa tiya, namba kakwamwina chakukufumisha kwakulehi, namba kaamwina nianyaneyi chakuyifumisha mwituŋa danamwenuwu wukoli. Yakoba wamba kafunta, wamba kashakama chakumwena zo-o, mumesu mwawunda be-te-te, niwakumutiyisha woma nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Muloŋa ami nidi neyi kulonda kukwamwinaŋa. Muloŋa ami namba kakumisha chikupu nyuza yejima kunakupalaŋesheleli, hakwila eyi hinamba kakukumisha chikupuku. Ilaŋa nakakubabeshaŋa mwawuŋaji, hinakakuleka nihanti chakadi kukubabeshaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Yehova nahoshi nindi, Yikatu yeyi yabulaŋa kuukewa, chitu cheyi chakala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hikudi wakukuhakwila muloŋa weyi kulonda wumoni kukukasa hachilondaku. Hiwukweti yitumbu yakukuukaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwenu ejima akukeŋa anakuvulameni dehi; hiya kukeŋakeŋaŋaku; muloŋa nakutapi dehi chitu chidi neyi chakukutapa kudi chilumbu, nakubabeshi neyi chakukubabesha kudi nkatu; nakuluwa kweyi kwasweja, nanshidi jeyi javula dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wukudililadi yikatu yeyi? Yikatu yeyi yabulaŋa kuukewa; muloŋa wakuluwa kweyi kwasweja, nanshidi jeyi jinavuli, dichi nakwilili yumiyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi antu ejima akakudyeyi niwena akayidya. Akwankunyi neyi ejima akaya muwukoli niwumu wakashalahu. Akakubuwaŋa eyi niwena akayibuwa. Akakupupaŋa eyi niwena akayipupa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Nakakukolesha cheŋi, nakakukuswisha yitu yeyi. Muloŋa anakuteni dehi nawu wakinjikewa, nawu, Diyi Ziyona abula kushawu antu kumuchima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nahoshi nindi, Tiyenu, nakabalumuna cheŋi wukoli wamatenti aYakoba, kwindi kwashakama shakamayi nakatiyilaku wushona. Nimukala nakawutuŋa cheŋi hamulumba wawu waweni, mwitala damwanta mwakashakama antu, neyi chashakaminaŋawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mudi wena mwakatiyakana kusakilila, nimazu awantu akuzaŋajala. Nakayivulisha, himwakakehaku. Nakayilemesha, himwakekala akadi kulemaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyanawu akekala neyi chadiŋuwu hakusambila, chipompelu chawu chakashimata kumesu ami, nakababesha antu ejima ayikabishaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulopu wawu wakekala wahadi awenawu, nyuli yawu wakafuma mudi wena. Nakamukundamisha kwakwihi, niyena wakakundama kudami. Ochu wadiŋi nawulobu wakwinza kudami hinyi? Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mwakekala antu ami, ninami nakekala Nzambi yenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu, mpepela yaYehova yeneni, kwokulendumuka kwindi, yinediki, himpepela yakombaŋa chakukomba. Yakabalukila hanamutu wamukwakwila chatama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuzuwa kwaYehova kwasweja hikwakafunta mwokuku, chiŋa neli dehi, chiŋa nakoŋi dehi yafuukulayi mumuchima windi. Chamba kayilumbulukila chikupu hamafuku akukuminina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
